{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01858",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.16,
      "end_seconds": 5.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.15,
      "end_seconds": 12.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "So, that's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.97,
      "end_seconds": 22.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.11,
      "text": "Let me think, honestly, it's loud snoring, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.18,
      "end_seconds": 31.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.85,
      "end_seconds": 35.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "I've had it for about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.71,
      "end_seconds": 39.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Have you noticed any triggers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.92,
      "end_seconds": 58.98,
      "duration_seconds": 15.06,
      "text": "Yes, alcohol. That makes it worse. I've also had morning headaches, for five days. With morning headaches, I'd give it a seven, out of ten. It's all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.31,
      "end_seconds": 76.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.48,
      "end_seconds": 88.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.83,
      "end_seconds": 116.46,
      "duration_seconds": 11.63,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 18, pulse is 77 beats a minute, blood pressure 166 over 92. And saturation 98 percent, temp 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.01,
      "end_seconds": 122.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.39,
      "end_seconds": 125.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.99,
      "end_seconds": 128.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.76,
      "end_seconds": 143.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "You have a thick neck and a crowded throat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.76,
      "end_seconds": 157.28,
      "duration_seconds": 9.52,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Let me check a few things. Any leg swelling, chest pain or falling asleep driving?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.83,
      "end_seconds": 164.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Mm, no, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.11,
      "end_seconds": 168.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "And choking, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.33,
      "end_seconds": 173.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Uh, not at all, no choking."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.58,
      "end_seconds": 178.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.36,
      "end_seconds": 183.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "No, um, that side's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.62,
      "end_seconds": 188.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.79,
      "end_seconds": 191.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Yes, naproxen. I get stomach pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.37,
      "end_seconds": 194.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.81,
      "end_seconds": 198.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.05,
      "end_seconds": 202.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "So, tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.91,
      "end_seconds": 211.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Lisinopril, 10 milligrams, once a day for my pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.42,
      "end_seconds": 215.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.72,
      "end_seconds": 223.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.7,
      "text": "For two years. I take escitalopram, once a day for the anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.02,
      "end_seconds": 226.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.05,
      "end_seconds": 232.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "10 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.97,
      "end_seconds": 251.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.51,
      "end_seconds": 254.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.83,
      "end_seconds": 256.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "I follow."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 257.67,
      "end_seconds": 260.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "I've had anxiety for two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.93,
      "end_seconds": 269.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Okay, I can see high blood pressure in your file as well. How about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.27,
      "end_seconds": 273.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.02,
      "end_seconds": 276.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.46,
      "end_seconds": 281.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.92,
      "end_seconds": 285.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Do you work outside the home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 287.32,
      "end_seconds": 291.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.33,
      "end_seconds": 296.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.77,
      "end_seconds": 300.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.21,
      "end_seconds": 304.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.11,
      "end_seconds": 309.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.91,
      "end_seconds": 330.98,
      "duration_seconds": 11.07,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, this looks most like probable obstructive sleep apnoea. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.98,
      "end_seconds": 333.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.74,
      "end_seconds": 356.94,
      "duration_seconds": 19.2,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like probable obstructive sleep apnoea, but I'd like to confirm. I think a home sleep study makes sense here, for snoring and apnoeas. I think a thyroid test makes sense here, for tiredness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.23,
      "end_seconds": 360.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "How long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.15,
      "end_seconds": 383.23,
      "duration_seconds": 21.08,
      "text": "Avoid alcohol in the evening, lose some weight if you can, and do not drive when drowsy. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. The sleep clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.13,
      "end_seconds": 387.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 388.57,
      "end_seconds": 395.31,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "Please come and see me after the sleep study. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 396.14,
      "end_seconds": 400.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "Good, you know, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 401.08,
      "end_seconds": 402.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}